library/books_online/pihkal/pihkal036.shtml"},{"title":"Wikipedia","description":"Encyclopedia article","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2C-P"},{"title":"Wikidata","description":"Structured data on 2C-P","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q209262"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/2C-P"},{"title":"维基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-cn/2C-P"}],"wikidata":"Q209262","formula":"C13H21NO2","molarMass":223.31,"pharmacology":{"text":"2C-P acts as an agonist of the serotonin 5-HT2 receptors. It also binds to the serotonin 5-HT1A receptor with about 14-fold lower affinity than for the serotonin 5-HT2A receptor. The drug shows little or no affinity for the monoamine transporters (MATs) and shows very weak or negligible monoamine reuptake inhibition. It shows high affinity for the rat trace amine-associated receptor 1 (TAAR1) and lower but still high affinity for the mouse TAAR1.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"2C-P","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2C-P#Pharmacodynamics","kind":"Serotonin 5-HT2 receptor agonist; Serotonin 5-HT2A receptor agonist; Serotonergic psychedelic; Hallucinogen","figures":"2C-P"},"uses":{"text":"It is taken orally and is among the most potent and long-lasting of the 2C psychedelics.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"2C-P","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2C-P","routes":"Oral","figures":"2C-P"},"summaryZh":"2C-P（2,5-二甲氧基-4-正丙基苯乙胺）是2C類化合物中的一種相對有效且作用時間較長的迷幻苯乙胺衍生物，它在加拿大、中國、丹麥、德國、瑞典、英國和美國受到管制。","summaryZhHans":"2C-P（2,5-二甲氧基-4-正丙基苯乙胺）是2C类化合物中的一种相对有效且作用时间较长的迷幻苯乙胺衍生物，它在加拿大、中国、丹麦、德国、瑞典、英国和美国受到管制。"}